<title>USA: Salomon underwrites Mercury Finance's purchase.</title>
<headline>Salomon underwrites Mercury Finance's purchase.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers' loan syndication group said on Wednesday it underwrote $750 million in bank loans for Mercury Finance Co's acquistion of Fidelity Acceptance Corp.</p>
<p>Salomon will serve as agent and syndicate manager on the transaction, furthermore Salomon will serve as the lead underwriter for an upcoming investment grade senior note offering.</p>
<p>Mercury Finance plans to refinance about $700 million of Fidelity's debt, they added.</p>
<p>((- Caryn Trokie, 212-859-1678))</p>
